@step Show the active profile's readiness summary.
aeat config profile status
@step Show the stored facts in full.
aeat config profile view
@step Validate the facts against the schema.
aeat config profile validate
@result aeat --format json app modelo readiness --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@expect result.profile_ready == true
@expect result.binding_ready == false
@expect exit_code == 2
